{
  "_about": "Scenes for forge/tools/golden.ts. Every run starts from a fresh data directory, opens the terminal from the launcher, fixes the clock, and optionally changes the theme; then it goes back home and runs the scene's steps. Steps are palanu-sim arguments (see platform/host/sim_main.c). The home and launcher screens are opened with uishow (a fixed clock, fixed notifications and a fixed wallpaper frame).",
